2026-09-23 11:54:29,359 INFO ipython === bench console session ===
2026-09-23 11:54:29,359 INFO ipython import frappe
2026-09-23 11:54:29,359 INFO ipython doctypes = [
    "VMS Vehicle Inspection",
    "VMS Spare Parts",
    "VMS Vehicle Service Registration"
]
2026-09-23 11:54:29,359 INFO ipython role = "VMS Technician"
2026-09-23 11:54:29,359 INFO ipython for dt in doctypes:
    existing = frappe.get_all("DocPerm", filters={"parent": dt, "role": role}, fields=["name"])
    if not existing:
        doc = frappe.new_doc("DocPerm")
        doc.parent = dt
        doc.parenttype = "DocType"
        doc.parentfield = "permissions"
        doc.role = role
        doc.read = 1
        doc.write = 1
        doc.create = 1
        doc.delete = 1
        doc.submit = 0
        doc.cancel = 0
        doc.amend = 0
        doc.insert()
        print(f"Added perms for {dt}")
    else:
        doc = frappe.get_doc("DocPerm", existing[0].name)
        doc.read = 1
        doc.write = 1
        doc.create = 1
        doc.delete = 1
        doc.save()
        print(f"Updated perms for {dt}")
frappe.db.commit()
2026-09-23 11:54:29,359 INFO ipython print("All done!")
2026-09-23 11:54:29,359 INFO ipython === session end ===
